# CRITICAL: This file preserves SEO equity from the legacy WordPress
# site. Every legacy URL discovered in Google's index is mapped here
# to its closest topical equivalent on the new static site.
#
# Redirect order: most specific → most general. Cloudflare/Netlify
# stop at the first match.
#
# Status code reference:
#   301 = Permanent (passes ~99% of link equity — USE FOR SEO MIGRATION)
#   302 = Temporary (DO NOT USE — Google may not consolidate signals)
#   410 = Gone (use only for permanently removed content)
#   200 = Rewrite (URL changes but content shows from new path)
# ═════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════


